    },
    {
      "reveal_topic": "sleep_elsewhere",
      "supports": "P2",
      "deny_first": true,
      "content": "挺奇怪，靠在沙发上容易睡，一躺床就精神。",
      "id": "A-029-c2"
    },
    {
      "reveal_topic": "bed_wakefulness",
      "supports": "P2",
      "deny_first": false,
      "content": "醒着也不离开床，就等睡意自己来，越等越清醒。",
      "id": "A-029-c3"
    },
    {
      "reveal_topic": "worry_rumination",
      "supports": "P3",
      "deny_first": false,
      "content": "拖得久了也开始担心，今晚会不会又睡不着。",
      "id": "A-029-c4"
    },
    {
      "reveal_topic": "leg_discomfort",
      "supports": "R2",
      "deny_first": true,
      "content": "一躺下小腿里面就酸麻，非得动一下才受得了。",
      "id": "A-029-c5"
    },
    {
      "reveal_topic": "leg_discomfort",
      "supports": "R2",
      "deny_first": false,
      "content": "只要在屋里走就会好一些，一停住又开始难受。",
      "id": "A-029-c6"
